(text "All connections are passive. Use 3.3 V logic. VIN, 5V and 3V3 are separate conductors." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 167 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid "779a8dad-3c47-507f-b031-4127a27deadb"))
(text "USB end marks the first contact of both module sockets. J7 and J8 run in reverse pad order." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 172 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid "d15244bc-8dc9-5e80-928e-410153e73b7a"))
(text "D8/COPI = MOSI.  D10/CIPO = MISO.  D11/SDA and D12/SCL are the main I2C bus." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 177 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid "308cb621-38c6-590b-bf62-c85df13bbada"))
